WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:04.943
On new-release day, open Ordering → Received.

2
00:00:04.943 --> 00:00:11.064
Every title out this week is listed with the copies coming. This week’s titles start ticked.

3
00:00:11.064 --> 00:00:17.844
Untick anything that didn’t arrive, then Mark… as Ready. Customers see their books as ready for pickup.

4
00:00:17.844 --> 00:00:23.920
Re-order is for titles past their cutoff, like trades that stay in print.
